  "content": "\n\n<p>專為使用 Scala 編寫的模組所設計的函式庫。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模組包含 Scala 標準程式庫，該程式庫已在 1.13.2 版本中被移除。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>提供語言載入器「kotori_scala」。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Scala(<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.scala-lang.org%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.scala-lang.org/</a>) 採用&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.apache.org%252flicenses%252fLICENSE-2.0\" rel=\"nofollow\">Apache 授權條款 2.0 版</a>&nbsp;授權（<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.scala-lang.org%252flicense%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.scala-lang.org/license/</a>）</li>\n<li>Cats(<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftypelevel.org%252fcats%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://typelevel.org/cats/</a>) 採用 MIT 授權條款（<a href=\"https://github.com/typelevel/cats/blob/master/COPYING\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/typelevel/cats/blob/master/COPYING</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">聯絡方式：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Discord: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ThxxGXMjZn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/ThxxGXMjZn</a></li>\n<li>GitHub: 請見下方</li>\n<li>Twitter: <a href=\"https://twitter.com/small_bird_316\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://twitter.com/small_bird_316</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>帶有「-fabric」後綴的檔案適用於 Fabric。</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>無後綴版本適用於 <strong>Minecraft Forge</strong>。</strong></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>原始碼</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Forge -&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Kotori316/SLP\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Kotori316/SLP</a></li>\n<li>Fabric -&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Kotori316/SLP-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Kotori316/SLP-fabric</a></li>\n</ul>",
